kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1230990/extras/408e2183bdabf66e523a23ef693bd9b2.avif?t=1666987097\" /></div><br></li><li>New cute merchant trader.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1230990/extras/b924f383345cc9efe46f14c751f7820d.avif?t=1666987097\" /></div><br></li><li>Mod-ing capabilities<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1230990/extras/b3c9e00fd745704e9be1f08d74396fa8.avif?t=1666987097\" /></div></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Banzai Escape\u036d\u036b 2 \u00a9 Xenoaisam Studio</h2>",
